OL,3,AWhite House says the US is lifting
OL,4,Atariffs on some Canadian goods
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US is lifting some of its 50%
OL,7,Ftariffs on Canadian goods, with the
OL,8,FWhite House saying on Friday it was
OL,9,Fworking to "protect the economic
OL,10,Fprosperity and national security of the
OL,11,FAmerican people".
OL,13,FThe exemptions could also boost
OL,14,FRepublican candidates in the midterms
OL,15,Felections on 3 November, as many US
OL,16,Fvoters list affordability and economic
OL,17,Fpressures as top issues.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
