OL,3,AWhite House says the US is lifting
OL,4,Atariffs on some Canadian goods
OL,5,
OL,6,FRepublican Senator Susan Collins, who
OL,7,Fis in a tight race in Maine to keep her
OL,8,Fseat in the election, first announced
OL,9,Fthe exemptions, saying they would help
OL,10,Fher state's agriculture industry.
OL,12,FAfter trade talks collapsed this
OL,13,Fsummer, the US and Canada started an
OL,14,Fescalating tariff war that has affected
OL,15,Fboth sides of the border.
